The license above covers Code X-Ray's own code. The extension package also
bundles the components below, each under its own license (texts and notices
in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and in the extension's dist/kitten folder). The
sizes are what each adds to the installed extension and to the download.

- Extension code, pages and icons: Code X-Ray (MIT).
  2.2 MB installed, 1.0 MB of the download.
- Analyses of TypeScript and JavaScript: TypeScript compiler 6.0.3 (Apache-2.0).
  23.2 MB installed, 4.4 MB of the download.
- C# support: tree-sitter and tree-sitter-c-sharp (MIT).
  5.8 MB installed, 0.4 MB of the download.
- Git reel natural voices: the voice model: Kitten TTS Nano 0.8 int8, by KittenML (Apache-2.0).
  23.2 MB installed, 19.6 MB of the download.
- Git reel natural voices: the eight voices: Kitten TTS voices file (Apache-2.0).
  3.1 MB installed, 2.9 MB of the download.
- Git reel natural voices: the model runtime: ONNX Runtime Web 1.24.3, by Microsoft (MIT).
  11.9 MB installed, 3.0 MB of the download.
- Git reel natural voices: pronunciation: eSpeak NG via phonemizer.js 1.2.1 (GPL-3.0, Apache-2.0).
  1.3 MB installed, 0.7 MB of the download.

Total: about 70.9 MB installed, a 32.0 MB download. The Git reel natural voices
(the last four) are 39.5 MB installed and 26.2 MB of the download; they run
only on your computer and can be turned off with the setting
tsStructure.reel.naturalVoices. eSpeak NG (GPL-3.0) runs as a separate program,
dist/kitten/phonemize.mjs, with the GPL text and a source notice next to it.

Not bundled: the Git reel code model, all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (Apache-2.0, by the
sentence-transformers team; int8 ONNX export by Xenova). 23.2 MB, downloaded
from Hugging Face only if you agree, into the extension's storage; turned off
with the setting tsStructure.reel.codeModel.
